   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>Have you been using tape or super glue to keep your shards secure? Worry no more, for this re-released 2020’s classic can ensure shards stay right where you need them to be.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Chipware Socket Enhancement.</strong> Any Chipware or Shard inserted into this Chipware Socket is immediately locked in place, and can only be removed with the correct electronic key — determined by the shard owner, not the Chipware Socket owner — or with the right tools (i.e., a techtool), beating a DV21 Cybertech Check, and 10 minutes.</p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Chipware Socket<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Neuralware).</em></p>"
